Bundle: code-quality
Version: 1.0.0
Description: golden corpus code-quality
Path: {PROJECT}/.ctxloom/content/bundles/v2/code-quality/bundle.yaml

MCP Servers (1):
  - postgres
      Command: mcp-postgres
      Args: --readonly
      Env:
        PGDATABASE=app
        PGHOST=localhost
        PGPORT=5432
      Notes:
        Read-only connection to the app database.
      Installation:
        brew install mcp-postgres

Fragments (2):
  - solid [go, design] (distilled)
      # SOLID
  - tricky [edge-case] (no_distill)
      Body with a horizontal rule below.

Commands (1):
  - review [review]
      Review a diff against the project's standards